{
 "id": "seg4",
 "title": "CEI与锁",
 "pill": 4,
 "total": 150.09,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg4-00",
   "text": "怎么防？首选，是 CEI 模式。",
   "spoken": "怎么防？首选，是 CEI 模式。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg4-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 4.272,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 5.029
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-01",
   "text": "CEI 是三个词：检查，修改状态，外部交互。函数按这个顺序写。",
   "spoken": "CEI 是三个词：检查，修改状态，外部交互。函数按这个顺序写。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg4-01.mp3",
   "start": 6.092,
   "dur": 7.296,
   "speechStart": 6.19,
   "speechEnd": 12.532
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-02",
   "text": "取款函数只改一处：把清零，挪到转账之前。",
   "spoken": "取款函数只改一处：把清零，挪到转账之前。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg4-02.mp3",
   "start": 13.608,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 13.706,
   "speechEnd": 17.813
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-03",
   "text": "这样重入进来时，读到的余额是 0，require 直接回滚。",
   "spoken": "这样虫入进来时，读到的余额是 0，require 直接回滚。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg4-03.mp3",
   "start": 18.868,
   "dur": 5.352,
   "speechStart": 18.966,
   "speechEnd": 23.37
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-04",
   "text": "交出控制权放在最后，此时账本已经一致。",
   "spoken": "交出控制权放在最后，此时账本已经一致。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg4-04.mp3",
   "start": 24.44,
   "dur": 4.152,
   "speechStart": 24.538,
   "speechEnd": 27.752
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-05",
   "text": "第二道防线，是重入锁。",
   "spoken": "第二道防线，是虫入锁。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg4-05.mp3",
   "start": 28.812,
   "dur": 2.832,
   "speechStart": 28.91,
   "speechEnd": 30.802
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-06",
   "text": "执行期间，再次进入任何一个加锁的函数，都会回滚。",
   "spoken": "执行期间，再次进入任何一个加锁的函数，都会回滚。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg4-06.mp3",
   "start": 31.864,
   "dur": 4.968,
   "speechStart": 31.962,
   "speechEnd": 35.997
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-07",
   "text": "但锁有边界。它只保护加了锁的函数，不防只读重入，跨合约还要共享同一把锁。",
   "spoken": "但锁有边界。它只保护加了锁的函数，不防只读虫入，跨合约还要共享同一把锁。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg4-07.mp3",
   "start": 37.052,
   "dur": 8.04,
   "speechStart": 37.15,
   "speechEnd": 44.278
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-08",
   "text": "0.8.24 起，可以用瞬态存储做锁，gas 更低。",
   "spoken": "0.8.24 起，可以用瞬态存储做锁，gas 更低。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg4-08.mp3",
   "start": 45.312,
   "dur": 4.968,
   "speechStart": 45.41,
   "speechEnd": 49.445
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-09",
   "text": "但目标链必须支持 EIP-1153，部署前要确认。",
   "spoken": "但目标链必须支持 EIP-1153，部署前要确认。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg4-09.mp3",
   "start": 50.5,
   "dur": 5.712,
   "speechStart": 50.598,
   "speechEnd": 55.36
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-10",
   "text": "还有一种思路，叫拉取式支付。合约只记账，由收款人自己来取。",
   "spoken": "还有一种思路，叫拉取式支付。合约只记账，由收款人自己来取。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg4-10.mp3",
   "start": 56.432,
   "dur": 6.36,
   "speechStart": 56.53,
   "speechEnd": 61.944
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-11",
   "text": "合约不主动推送，代价是用户要多走一步。",
   "spoken": "合约不主动推送，代价是用户要多走一步。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg4-11.mp3",
   "start": 63.012,
   "dur": 4.416,
   "speechStart": 63.11,
   "speechEnd": 66.598
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-12",
   "text": "CEI 也有局限。复杂函数里，很难做到所有交互都在最后。",
   "spoken": "CEI 也有局限。复杂函数里，很难做到所有交互都在最后。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg4-12.mp3",
   "start": 67.648,
   "dur": 6.192,
   "speechStart": 67.746,
   "speechEnd": 72.993
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-13",
   "text": "所以要做纵深防御，分四条。",
   "spoken": "所以要做纵深防御，分四条。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg4-13.mp3",
   "start": 74.06,
   "dur": 3.408,
   "speechStart": 74.158,
   "speechEnd": 76.646
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-14",
   "text": "一，把 CEI 当作默认写法。",
   "spoken": "一，把 CEI 荡作默认写法。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg4-14.mp3",
   "start": 77.688,
   "dur": 3.24,
   "speechStart": 77.786,
   "speechEnd": 80.095
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-15",
   "text": "二，所有修改共享状态的外部入口，加同一把锁。",
   "spoken": "二，所有修改共享状态的外部入口，加同一把锁。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg4-15.mp3",
   "start": 81.148,
   "dur": 5.16,
   "speechStart": 81.246,
   "speechEnd": 85.496
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-16",
   "text": "三，不在 view 函数里给出中间状态的关键价格。必须给出，就提供锁状态查询。",
   "spoken": "三，不在 view 函数里给出中间状态的关键价格。必须给出，就提供锁状态查询。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg4-16.mp3",
   "start": 86.528,
   "dur": 7.944,
   "speechStart": 86.626,
   "speechEnd": 93.623
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-17",
   "text": "四，用不变量测试守住一件事：任何调用序列之后，合约余额都不少于用户余额之和。",
   "spoken": "四，用不变量测试守住一件事：任何掉用序列之后，合约余额都不少于用户余额之和。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg4-17.mp3",
   "start": 94.692,
   "dur": 8.448,
   "speechStart": 94.79,
   "speechEnd": 102.313
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-18",
   "text": "修复还要用代码验证。同一个攻击测试，在漏洞版上要能提走资金，在修复版上要回滚。",
   "spoken": "修复还要用代码验证。同一个攻击测试，在漏洞版上要能提走资金，在修复版上要回滚。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg4-18.mp3",
   "start": 103.36,
   "dur": 8.184,
   "speechStart": 103.458,
   "speechEnd": 110.717
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-19",
   "text": "只跑通修复版，无法证明测试真的覆盖了漏洞。",
   "spoken": "只跑通修复版，无法证明测试真的覆盖了漏洞。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg4-19.mp3",
   "start": 111.764,
   "dur": 4.608,
   "speechStart": 111.862,
   "speechEnd": 115.528
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-20",
   "text": "最后，锁写对了，也不一定生效。",
   "spoken": "最后，锁写对了，也不一定生效。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg4-20.mp3",
   "start": 116.592,
   "dur": 3.6,
   "speechStart": 116.69,
   "speechEnd": 119.356
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-21",
   "text": "2023 年 7 月，Curve 的一些池子，源码里写了重入锁。",
   "spoken": "2023 年 7 月，Curve 的一些池子，源码里写了虫入锁。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg4-21.mp3",
   "start": 120.412,
   "dur": 5.088,
   "speechStart": 120.51,
   "speechEnd": 124.676
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-22",
   "text": "但 Vyper 编译器的三个版本，生成的锁不正确，不同函数用了不同的锁槽。",
   "spoken": "但 Vyper 编译器的三个版本，生成的锁不正确，不同函数用了不同的锁槽。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg4-22.mp3",
   "start": 125.72,
   "dur": 6.24,
   "speechStart": 125.818,
   "speechEnd": 131.139
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-23",
   "text": "攻击者对使用原生 ETH 的池子，发起跨函数重入。",
   "spoken": "攻击者对使用原生 ETH 的池子，发起跨函数虫入。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg4-23.mp3",
   "start": 132.18,
   "dur": 4.68,
   "speechStart": 132.278,
   "speechEnd": 136.04
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-24",
   "text": "按多方公开复盘，损失约 7000 万美元。",
   "spoken": "按多方公开复盘，损失约 7000 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg4-24.mp3",
   "start": 137.08,
   "dur": 4.344,
   "speechStart": 137.178,
   "speechEnd": 140.582
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-25",
   "text": "教训是，源码正确，不等于字节码正确。审计范围要包括编译器版本。",
   "spoken": "教训是，源码正确，不等于字节码正确。审计范围要包括编译器版本。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg4-25.mp3",
   "start": 141.644,
   "dur": 7.248,
   "speechStart": 141.742,
   "speechEnd": 148.049
  }
